  exhibitName: Royal Crown
  description: "This ornate crown is a modern reproduction inspired by traditional
    European royal regalia. Designed as a prop rather than a ceremonial object, it
    features a velvet cap enclosed by an openwork metal frame adorned with coloured
    glass jewels. The decorative motifs\u2014floral clusters, filigree patterns,
    and cabochon stones\u2014imitate the luxurious embellishment of historic crowns."
